  "details": "# Issue:\n\nIn the Main Menu Search Tab we now have two \"suggested\" Searches, the Recommended Searches and the Quick World Searches. Both of these come with their own separate buttons for suggestions.\n\nFor some reason the buttons of the Recommended Search have a sightly different color than the buttons for the Quick World Searches.\n\n# Expected Behavior:\n\nThe buttons for the Recommended and Quick World Searches should have the same color palette, just like every other button in the menu.\n\nThis should be the case for two reasons:\n\n1. General UI consistency\n\n2. Custom Color Palettes now being a thing, since there we also can only define one color for buttons\n\n \n\n# Attachments:\n\nHere is a picture showcasing the issue:",
